flowchart TD
    Start([Simulation Start]) --> Init1[Create SimPy Environment]
    Init1 --> Init2[Create EnergySandbox<br/>Power Grid: simpy.Container]
    Init2 --> Init3[Create ChargingColumns<br/>simpy.Resource n_ports each]
    Init3 --> Init4[Spawn Vehicle Processes]
    Init4 --> Run[Run Simulation]
    
    Run --> VStart
    Run --> CStart
    
    VStart([Vehicle Process]) --> V1[Vehicle Arrives]
    V1 --> V2[Search for Available Column]
    V2 --> V3{Port<br/>Available?}
    V3 -->|No| V4[Wait]
    V4 --> V5{Timeout?}
    V5 -->|Yes| VEnd1([Leave Unserved])
    V5 -->|No| V3
    V3 -->|Yes| V6[Request Column Resource]
    V6 --> V7{Acquired<br/>in Time?}
    V7 -->|No| VEnd2([Leave - Timeout])
    V7 -->|Yes| V8[Signal: arrival_event]
    V8 --> V9[Wait for charge_cmpt_event<br/>OR park_end]
    V9 --> V9A{Park End<br/>Reached?}
    V9A -->|No| V9B[Wait Until park_end]
    V9B --> V10
    V9A -->|Yes| V10[Signal: request_disconnect]
    V10 --> V11[Wait: request_disconnect_approved]
    V11 --> V12[Release Column Resource]
    V12 --> VEnd3([Vehicle Leaves])
    
    CStart([ChargingColumn Process]) --> C1[Wait for arrival_event<br/>or Check Connected EVs]
    C1 --> C2[Select Next EV]
    C2 --> C2A[FCFS: Earliest assign_time<br/>SHRD: Oldest last_charge_time]
    C2A --> C3{Handshake with EV}
    C3 -->|Successful| C4{Power<br/>Needed?}
    C3 -->|Unsuccessful| C3A[Wait 60 sec]
    C3A --> C1
    C4 -->|No| C9
    C4 -->|Yes| C5[Request Power from EnergySandbox]
    C5 --> C6{Power<br/>Granted?}
    C6 -->|No - Disconnect| C9
    C6 -->|Yes| C7[Deliver Energy in Window]
    C7 --> C8{Continue<br/>Charging?}
    C8 -->|Yes| C4
    C8 -->|No| C11
    C9[Signal: charge_cmpt_event &<br/>request_disconnect_approved] --> C10[Break Handshake]
    C10 --> C1
    C11{Disconnect Requested?<br/>OR<br/>Charge Completed?} -->|Yes| C9
    C11 -->|No| C10
    
    E1[EnergySandbox] --> E2[Request Power]
    E2 --> E3{Available in<br/>Container?}
    E3 -->|No| E4[Queue]
    E4 --> E3
    E3 -->|Yes| E5[Allocate Power]
    E5 --> E6[Column Uses Power]
    E6 --> E7[Release Power Back]